    "sections": {
        "description": "The Construction – Modern, Flexible, and Fully Customizable WordPress Theme. The Construction is a versatile and professional WordPress theme designed for construction companies, corporate businesses, educational organizations, consultancies, creative agencies, and a wide variety of professional websites. Powered by the intuitive Elementor page builder, it allows you to craft visually stunning and high-performance websites without writing a single line of code. With its clean, modern design and extensive customization features, The Construction gives you full control over your website’s look and feel. Choose from unlimited colors, adjust sidebars, and set flexible background options to create a website that perfectly represents your brand. Whether you are building a construction site, corporate portal, or agency website, The Construction offers the flexibility, speed, and SEO-friendly structure to help your site stand out online. Discover all features and live demos at https://www.templatehouse.net/themes/constructo-construction-wordpress-theme/"
    },
